## File Structure

```
_planning/                    # Task planning directory (iteration persistent)
├── mission_plan.md          # Task plan + success criteria + progress log
├── mission_notes.md         # Research findings + decisions + failure records (append-only)
└── workflow_state.json      # State machine current position (supports interrupt recovery)
```

### mission_plan.md Template

```markdown
# Mission Plan

## Objective
[Task objective - extracted from user request]

## Success Criteria
- [ ] [Specific verifiable criterion 1]
- [ ] [Specific verifiable criterion 2]
- [ ] [Validation passes (compile/lint/test)]

## Context
- Module path: src/modules/xxx/
- Architecture layers: Data/Service/UI
- Related constraints: [Project-specific constraints]

## Phases

### Phase 1: Research & Discovery
- [ ] Understand complete requirements
- [ ] Explore existing code/context
- [ ] Identify dependencies and constraints

### Phase 2: Implementation
- [ ] [Specific task 1]
- [ ] [Specific task 2]
- [ ] [Specific task 3]

### Phase 3: Verification
- [ ] Compile/Lint validation
- [ ] Constraint check

## Progress Log
| Iteration | Phase | Actions Taken | Status |
|-----------|-------|---------------|--------|
| 1 | Init | Created planning structure | In Progress |
```

### mission_notes.md Template

```markdown
# Mission Notes

## Research Findings
[Append findings with timestamps]

## Decisions Made
[Record choices and reasoning]

## Failures & Learnings
[CRITICAL! Record all failures - for next iteration learning]
- [Time] [What failed] -> [What learned] -> [What to try next]

## Self-Reflections
[Reflexion self-reflection records - structured reflection after validation failure]
- [Iter N, Attempt M] {error message}
  Reflection: {root cause + improvement plan + similar pitfalls}
  Strategy: {fix immediately / record pending / ask user}
  Status: {fixed / next iteration / waiting}

Max retained: 3 (remove oldest when exceeded)

## Clarifications
[User clarification records - from confidence check results]
- [Iter N] Q: [Question asked]
  A: [User answer]
  -> Impact: [Effect on implementation]

## Open Questions
[Unresolved questions]
```

