## Workflow

```
===============================================================
                    MISSION RUNNER Workflow (PIR Mode)
===============================================================

Phase 0: Initialization
├── 1. Parse user task description
├── 2. Create _planning/ directory:
│      mkdir -p _planning
├── 3. Create mission_plan.md (task plan)
├── 4. Create mission_notes.md (empty notes)
└── 5. Start iteration loop (default 3 iterations)

---------------------------------------------------------------

Each Iteration (1-N):

+- Step 1: Read-Before-Decide (Goal Anchoring) ----------------+
|  Read _planning/mission_plan.md                              |
|  - Confirm: What is Objective?                               |
|  - Confirm: Which Phase are we in?                           |
|  - Confirm: What is next uncompleted [ ] task?               |
|  Read _planning/mission_notes.md                             |
|  - Check: What failures/learnings from last iteration?       |
|  - Check: Previous Clarifications records                    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
           |
           v
+- Step 1.5: Confidence Check ---------------------------------+
|  Evaluate current task on 4 dimensions (1-5 scale):          |
|  - Understanding: Are requirements clear?                    |
|  - Certainty: Is approach unique?                            |
|  - Clarity: Are APIs/modules clear?                          |
|  - Risk: Are side effects controllable?                      |
|                                                              |
|  Calculate average and decide:                               |
|  ├─ >= 4 (Green): Continue Step 2                            |
|  ├─ 3-4 (Yellow): Record concerns, continue Step 2           |
|  └─ < 3 (Red): Ask user, record to Clarifications            |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
           |
           v
+- Step 2: Execute --------------------------------------------+
|  Execute current task (one at a time!)                       |
|  Follow project constraints                                  |
|                                                              |
|  Update mission_plan.md in real-time:                        |
|  - Mark completed task [x] immediately                       |
|  - Update Progress Log table                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
           |
           v
+- Step 3: Validate -------------------------------------------+
|  Check if code passes validation (compile/lint/test)         |
|  If errors -> Enter Step 3.5 Self-Reflection                 |
|  If no errors -> Skip Step 3.5, proceed to Step 4            |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
           |
           v (if failed)
+- Step 3.5: Self-Reflection ----------------------------------+
|  **Trigger**: Step 3 validation failed                       |
|                                                              |
|  1. Generate reflection (using Self-Reflection Prompt):      |
|     - Why did this implementation fail? (root cause)         |
|     - How should it be modified? (specific solution)         |
|     - Any similar pitfalls to avoid? (learn by analogy)      |
|                                                              |
|  2. Choose strategy based on error type:                     |
|     ├─ Simple (typo/import): Fix immediately, same iteration |
|     ├─ Medium (logic): Record reflection, next iteration     |
|     └─ Complex (architecture): Ask user for direction        |
|                                                              |
|  3. Update mission_notes.md:                                 |
|     ## Self-Reflections                                       |
|     - [Iter N, Attempt M] {error message}                    |
|       Reflection: {why failed + how to improve}              |
|       Strategy: {fix immediately / record pending / ask}     |
|       Status: {fixed / next iteration / waiting}             |
|                                                              |
|  4. If "fix immediately":                                    |
|     -> Return to Step 2 (within same iteration)              |
|     -> Max 2 retries, then record and proceed to next iter   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
           |
           v
+- Step 4: Checkpoint -----------------------------------------+
|  Update Progress Log:                                        |
|  | N | Phase X | Completed xxx, encountered yyy | Done |     |
|                                                              |
|  Check: All tasks complete?                                  |
|  ├─ Yes + validation passes -> Mission Accomplished          |
|  └─ No -> Continue next iteration                            |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+

---------------------------------------------------------------

Phase 4: Debrief
├── Confirm all Success Criteria marked [x]
├── Keep mission_notes.md as historical record
└── If not fully complete, report remaining work
```

