## Usage

### Manual Invocation

```
[MISSION RUNNER - PIR MODE]

## Task
Add order refund feature to e-commerce system

## Phase 0: Initialization
1. mkdir -p _planning
2. Create mission_plan.md and mission_notes.md
3. Break down tasks into Phases

## Iteration Rules (Must Execute Each Iteration)
1. Read-Before-Decide: Read _planning/mission_plan.md
2. Execute: Execute next [ ] task, mark [x]
3. Validate: Validation check, append errors to mission_notes.md
4. Checkpoint: Update Progress Log

## Completion Criteria
Output after all Success Criteria marked [x] and validation passes:
<promise>Mission Accomplished</promise>
```

